@adminToken = admin-token-placeholder


### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản mới
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zalo1@gmail.com",
  "password": "Dinhcongmanh1@",
  "name": "Tien DQ",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

### 2. Đăng nhập
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zalo1@gmail.com",
  "password": "NewPassword123!"
}


### 5. Đổi mật khẩu (cần token)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Dinhcongmanh1@",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 6. Refresh token (cần token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Quên mật khẩu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 8. Đăng xuất (cần token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Test quyền admin (cần token admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Test quyền admin (cần token admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
